WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.951 --> 00:00:16.272
that day Wukong had been in a gloomy swamp, looking for his friends.

2
00:00:16.292 --> 00:00:19.513
"They never learn!"

3
00:00:19.893 --> 00:00:20.293
he said.

4
00:00:20.313 --> 00:00:22.754
"I left them here for two minutes.

5
00:00:23.394 --> 00:00:24.414
Now they're gone!"

6
00:00:25.334 --> 00:00:28.575
Just then he spotted two demons sitting on a log near a cave.

7
00:00:29.416 --> 00:00:30.676
One was a crocodile demon.

8
00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:32.560
The other one looked like a plant.

9
00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:37.002
"I'm glad we caught the Tang Monk," the crocodile demon said.

10
00:00:37.022 --> 00:00:39.122
"I can't wait for dinner!"

11
00:00:39.983 --> 00:00:41.203
The plant demon grinned.

12
00:00:41.223 --> 00:00:43.884
"I can't wait to live forever.

13
00:00:44.504 --> 00:00:46.024
Our friends will be jealous."

14
00:00:47.445 --> 00:00:49.885
They laughed, and the plant demon fell off the log.

15
00:00:50.505 --> 00:00:53.446
Bonk! Then they laughed even harder.

16
00:00:55.867 --> 00:00:56.947
Wukong shook his head.

17
00:00:56.967 --> 00:00:59.088
"These demons are dumb."

18
00:00:59.884 --> 00:01:01.985
He recited a spell and turned into a frog.

19
00:01:03.425 --> 00:01:04.725
He hopped over to the demons.

20
00:01:04.745 --> 00:01:08.086
"Are you really going to eat the Tang Monk?"

21
00:01:09.006 --> 00:01:10.307
The crocodile demon nodded.

22
00:01:10.327 --> 00:01:13.068
"We'll eat his companions too."

23
00:01:14.028 --> 00:01:17.469
"But he has three companions," Wukong said.

24
00:01:17.489 --> 00:01:19.549
"That'll be a huge meal.

25
00:01:20.009 --> 00:01:21.270
You'll get a stomachache!"

26
00:01:22.050 --> 00:01:24.170
"Nah," the plant demon said.

27
00:01:24.190 --> 00:01:29.652
"He only has two companions—a pig and a purple fellow."

28
00:01:30.304 --> 00:01:31.605
Wukong raised an eyebrow.

29
00:01:31.625 --> 00:01:34.247
"What about Sun Wukong?"

30
00:01:35.128 --> 00:01:36.189
The plant demon gulped.

31
00:01:36.209 --> 00:01:39.031
"I thought he left the Tang Monk."

32
00:01:39.672 --> 00:01:41.073
The crocodile demon trembled.

33
00:01:42.694 --> 00:01:44.736
"Is Sun Wukong still around?"

34
00:01:44.756 --> 00:01:48.899
"Yep!" Wukong returned to his true form.

35
00:01:48.919 --> 00:01:52.122
"Ahh!" The demons ran away.

36
00:01:52.142 --> 00:01:56.105
Wukong laughed and walked toward the cave.

37
00:01:58.247 --> 00:01:59.688
His friends were already coming out.

38
00:02:01.396 --> 00:02:02.517
Sha Wujing smiled.

39
00:02:02.537 --> 00:02:05.878
"We escaped on our own this time, Wukong."

40
00:02:05.898 --> 00:02:07.559
"Yeah, Wukong!"

41
00:02:08.159 --> 00:02:09.679
Zhu Bajie puffed his chest.

42
00:02:10.180 --> 00:02:11.560
"We didn't need your help."

43
00:02:12.661 --> 00:02:13.581
"Are you kidding?"

44
00:02:13.961 --> 00:02:14.802
Wukong snapped.

45
00:02:14.822 --> 00:02:16.742
"I scared off the demons!"

46
00:02:16.762 --> 00:02:19.964
"Please don't argue," the Tang Monk said.

47
00:02:19.984 --> 00:02:22.024
"You're all very helpful."

48
00:02:22.905 --> 00:02:24.125
Suddenly a portal appeared.

49
00:02:24.866 --> 00:02:26.626
A creature wearing armor stepped out.

50
00:02:26.646 --> 00:02:30.288
"I'm looking for Sun Wukong."

51
00:02:31.296 --> 00:02:32.176
"Oh, really?"

52
00:02:33.177 --> 00:02:34.077
Wukong grinned.

53
00:02:34.097 --> 00:02:36.257
"Do you know what he looks like?"

54
00:02:36.277 --> 00:02:38.938
"No," the creature said.

55
00:02:38.958 --> 00:02:42.399
"But he's probably huge and scary."

56
00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:44.640
"Why do you think that?"

57
00:02:44.940 --> 00:02:45.900
Wukong asked.

58
00:02:45.920 --> 00:02:50.261
"I met several demons," the creature said.

59
00:02:50.281 --> 00:02:53.802
"They're all scared of Sun Wukong."

60
00:02:54.683 --> 00:02:56.703
"That's true," Wukong said.

61
00:02:56.723 --> 00:02:59.084
"Demons are afraid of me."

62
00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.261
The creature tilted its head.

63
00:03:01.281 --> 00:03:03.983
"You're Sun Wukong?"

64
00:03:05.004 --> 00:03:08.366
"Yes." The creature burst into laughter.

65
00:03:09.847 --> 00:03:10.888
Wukong frowned.

66
00:03:10.908 --> 00:03:12.309
"Why are you laughing?"

67
00:03:12.329 --> 00:03:15.471
"You're a monkey," he said.

68
00:03:16.212 --> 00:03:17.432
Now Bajie laughed.

69
00:03:18.233 --> 00:03:20.174
"Yeah, he's our pet monkey!

70
00:03:20.695 --> 00:03:22.016
His name is Sprinkles."

71
00:03:22.936 --> 00:03:24.117
Wukong spun around.

72
00:03:24.137 --> 00:03:25.838
"Be quiet, Bajie!"

73
00:03:26.439 --> 00:03:27.740
He turned back to the creature.

74
00:03:28.364 --> 00:03:31.287
"I once defeated Heaven's entire army."

75
00:03:31.307 --> 00:03:33.468
"That's not true."

76
00:03:34.049 --> 00:03:34.809
Bajie laughed.

77
00:03:35.550 --> 00:03:37.472
"Don't listen to him."

78
00:03:38.112 --> 00:03:42.115
"Grr!" Wukong pulled out his iron bar.

79
00:03:42.636 --> 00:03:43.436
He grew bigger.

80
00:03:47.119 --> 00:03:48.380
Bajie stopped laughing.

81
00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:49.861
"Calm down, Wukong.

82
00:03:50.342 --> 00:03:51.283
I'm only joking."

83
00:03:52.223 --> 00:03:54.545
"Aha!" the creature said.

84
00:03:54.565 --> 00:03:57.768
"You are Sun Wukong."

85
00:03:58.740 --> 00:03:59.721
Wukong sighed.

86
00:03:59.741 --> 00:04:03.264
"Yes. Now tell me what Hey!"

87
00:04:06.287 --> 00:04:08.809
An invisible force pulled Wukong toward the portal.

88
00:04:09.289 --> 00:04:13.233
The Tang Monk gasped as Wujing and Bajie tried to draw their weapons.

89
00:04:13.253 --> 00:04:15.995
"I can't move!"

90
00:04:16.335 --> 00:04:17.076
Wujing said.

91
00:04:23.942 --> 00:04:25.964
The portal closed behind Wukong.

92
00:04:27.712 --> 00:04:29.193
He was now in a clear cube.

93
00:04:30.134 --> 00:04:31.195
"Let me out!"

94
00:04:31.875 --> 00:04:33.397
Wukong swung his iron bar.

95
00:04:33.897 --> 00:04:35.939
Bam! But the wall didn't break.

96
00:04:36.499 --> 00:04:38.721
Wukong punched and kicked and shouted.

97
00:04:41.343 --> 00:04:42.364
Finally he gave up.

98
00:04:43.004 --> 00:04:44.666
"How will I get out of here?"

99
00:04:46.227 --> 00:04:49.650
Later the Battle Master explained the rules of the Galactic Battle Bonanza.

100
00:04:50.550 --> 00:04:51.531
Wukong felt better.

101
00:04:51.551 --> 00:04:54.133
"I'll just destroy every other fighter.

102
00:04:54.774 --> 00:04:56.996
This will be easy—and fun!"
